<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20553] MDD: DoM not detected on SEL (DoM + extension) layouts</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20553</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Discovered during work on &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20534" title="FLR-EC: Stripe replacement: swapping individual stripes between components" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20534"&gt;LU-20534&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;mdd_lmm_dom_size()  only accepted  LOV_MAGIC_COMP_V1 . Files with a DoM component plus an extension component use  LOV_MAGIC_SEL  (same composite layout blob).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Those files were treated as non-DoM, so:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;mdd_attr_set  did not drop  LA_SIZE  (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-10509" title="sanity-dom test_fsx: FAIL: test_fsx failed with 110" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-10509"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-10509&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-style workaround).&lt;br/&gt;
mdd_swap_layouts  missed DoM size checks (e.g. plain swap allowed where migration rules should apply; wrong  mdd_dom_fixup()  when migrating between DoM layouts).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment />
